   299	## V1.0.0 P7：4 倍速以上的降噪（Gemini v100 r5：爆爆羊爆炸、史萊姆分裂、小石魔拍地不能省）
   300	const FAST_SPEED := 4.0
   301	const FAST_SKIP := ["pages", "bonesup", "woodwave", "axearc", "healring", "scorch", "inkring", "dust", "puff", "chips", "bones", "coins", "ripple", "note", "hex", "trip", "soulrise"]
